  "scope": "Stage146 adds actual PDF/DOCX/XLSX/PPTX page rendering, complete authorized asset search and explicit historical version selection across Web, frameless Windows Desktop and the native Chrome right Side Panel. Current session and source authority are checked around reads; no model request is made. Original attempts and whole-product, native OS and production acceptance scopes are retained.",
